      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit only the two foreground hands resting together at the center of this close-up. Separate them gently: the hand on the left side of the image holds a small round golden shield upright on the left of the lap, and the hand on the right side holds a compact neatly coiled gold rope on the right of the lap. Each of these two hands holds exactly one object with clearly shaped natural fingers and a coherent wrist. Keep the arms, red sari, green blouse, jewelry, lion and lighting unchanged. Preserve the same composition and all other visible details. There are still only two foreground hands, without any additional hands or arms. The shield is a plain round shield, and the rope is a rope coil, not jewelry or a flower."
